{"resourceIdentifier":"1740","resourceName":"Reforestation with Teak  CO2e TEAKMEX","description":"The forestry project Reforestation with Teak  CO2e TEAKMEX is an ARR grouped reforestation carbon project based on the planting of Tectona grandis. The region of expansion of the grouped project covers the states of Tabasco, Chiapas, and Campeche in the United States of Mexico. Within these states, the project area of the first instance spans 4,011.96 ha1 across five municipalities: Balancan (Tabasco), Huimanguillo (Tabasco), Tenosique (Tabasco), Palenque (Chiapas), and Candelaria (State of Campeche). These municipalities are all rural, and extensive livestock farming is the primary land use, followed by agriculture.  This project was open for public comment from 5 February - 7 March 2018. No comments were received.","location":{"latitude":17.313614,"longitude":-91.143129},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":null,"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1740"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Tabasco"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agropecuaria Santa Genoveva S.A.P.I. de C.V"},{"type":"string","value":"Campeche, Mexico"},{"type":"string","value":"+(52) 981 813 2066"},{"type":"string","value":"victor.fernandez@genoveva.com.mx"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"1740"},{"type":"bufferSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"1740"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"25329"}]},{"code":"TOTAL_BUFFER_POOL_CREDITS","values":[{"type":"integer","value":220463}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ARR"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAM